flowchart TD
START["START: executePaymentSaga<br/>Recibe: InitiatePaymentCommand"]
START --> VALIDATE["VALIDATE & RESERVE<br/>Wallet Service<br/>← Fondos de reserva"]
VALIDATE -->|Éxito| RESERVED["FUNDS_RESERVED<br/>Cantidad bloqueada (TTL: 10m)<br/>Añadir compensación: liberar"]
VALIDATE -->|Fallo| FAIL1["FAIL: Fondos insuficientes<br/>No se necesitan compensaciones"]
RESERVED --> FRAUD["FRAUD CHECK<br/>Servicio de fraude<br/>← Score de transacción"]
FRAUD -->|Score < 0.7| PASSED["FRAUD_CHECKED<br/>Riesgo bajo<br/>Continuar →"]
FRAUD -->|Score > 0.7| FAIL2["FAIL: Fraud Blocked<br/>Compensaciones:<br/>1. Liberar fondos"]
PASSED --> BANK["PROCESS BANK<br/>Bank Gateway<br/>← Call /process-payment"]
BANK -->|Success| CONFIRMED["CONFIRMED<br/>status = CONFIRMED<br/>Añadir compensación: reembolso"]
BANK -->|Timeout| RETRY["RETRY<br/>Retroceso exponencial<br/>Max 3 attempts"]
RETRY -->|Success| CONFIRMED
RETRY -->|All failed| FAIL3["FAIL: Banco no disponible<br/>Compensaciones:<br/>1. Pago de reembolso<br/>2. Liberar fondos"]
FAIL1 --> END1["END: FAILED"]
FAIL2 --> COMP["COMPENSATION"]
FAIL3 --> COMP
COMP --> COMP1["Ejecutar compensación #1:<br/>Liberación wallet"]
COMP1 -->|Success| COMP2["Ejecutar compensación #2:<br/>Reembolso en el banco"]
COMP1 -->|Failure| ALERT["ALERT OPS<br/>Se necesita revisión manual"]
COMP2 -->|Success| END2["END: FAILED_COMPENSATED"]
COMP2 -->|Failure| ALERT
CONFIRMED --> SUCCESS["SUCCESS<br/>status = CONFIRMED<br/>Publish: PaymentConfirmed<br/>Notificaciones enviadas"]
SUCCESS --> END3["END: CONFIRMED"]
ALERT --> MANUAL["Manual Ops<br/>Restaurar wallet<br/>Actualizar status"]
